00:05:17.970 --> 00:05:19.200
and still other neural circuits

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:20.550
that are engaged for task switching,

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:23.010
so the notion of a smart drug

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:25.980
or a drug that can induce
smartness, if you will,

00:05:25.980 --> 00:05:28.290
is simply not grounded in science.

